ce at least the 15th century. From these pastoral origins it migrated — via the French and Spanish armies, who adopted it as military headwear in the 19th century — into the wardrobes of artists and intellectuals worldwide, becoming one of the most politically charged items of clothing in history. The region it is named after is notable for several other reasons: its people speak Y, a language with no known relatives among any living or dead language family making it one of the great mysteries of European prehistory. ID X (10 points), Y (10 points).", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-23T03:29:40Z", "username": "Saumay", "text": "Kp would be leading even without the connect", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-23T03:29:46Z", "username": "Khandoba", "text": "Better", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-23T03:29:47Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "Beret", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-23T03:29:49Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "Basque", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-23T03:29:53Z", "username": "Khandoba", "text": "Beret", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-23T03:29:53Z", "username": "Saumay", "text": "Beret", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-23T03:30:00Z", "username": "Khandoba", "text": "Freaking", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-23T03:30:03Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "did autocorrect get you?", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-23T03:30:07Z", "username": "Kartikey Prad